        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "An important element of our business strategy is to progress our product candidates efficiently through the development process.",
        "start_character": 6192,
        "end_character": 6320
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By outsourcing certain aspects of our operations, we are able to focus financial resources directly where they provide the most benefit and reduce our business risk.",
        "start_character": 6769,
        "end_character": 6934
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Cost-control initiatives could decrease the price we might establish for products that we may develop or sell, which would result in lower product revenues or royalties payable to us.",
        "start_character": 102924,
        "end_character": 103107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are aware of a number of products in development that would offer alternatives to anti-VEGF therapies, which could affect the competitive environment for our products, including Rezolute Inc.’s RZ402, Merck & Co.",
        "start_character": 49282,
        "end_character": 49510
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial potential could also be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are safer, more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient or are less expensive than products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 43927,
        "end_character": 44190
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pursuant to the Merger, on the Closing Date, we acquired Astria’s lead product candidate navenibart, a injectable monoclonal antibody designed to inhibit plasma kallikrein for the treatment of HAE.",
        "start_character": 16993,
        "end_character": 17190
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "See “Risk Factors—Risks Relating to Our Business—Risks Relating to Product Development and Commercialization—There can be no assurance that our or our partners’ commercialization efforts, methods, and strategies for our products or technologies will succeed, and our future revenue generation is uncertain” in Part I, Item 1A of this report for further discussion of these risks.",
        "start_character": 10831,
        "end_character": 11210
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Structure-guided drug design is a process by which we design a product candidate through detailed structural analysis of the protein target, which the product candidate must inhibit in order to stop the progression of the disease or disorder.",
        "start_character": 4262,
        "end_character": 4504
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These government regulations are a significant factor in the production and marketing of any pharmaceutical or biological products that we develop or acquire.",
        "start_character": 54429,
        "end_character": 54587
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We and all of our contract manufacturers are also required to comply with the applicable FDA current Good Manufacturing Practice (“cGMP”) regulations during clinical development and to ensure that the product can be consistently manufactured to meet the specifications submitted in an NDA or BLA.",
        "start_character": 64507,
        "end_character": 64803
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012240",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012240-2e6ffd79c685e3f6",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012240",
